          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Large",
            "weight": "Bolder",
            "text": "New Jersey's effective date arrives — and slips: the AG's office now calls July 31 the rehearing deadline, with the bans expected to fall in August.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "Today was supposed to be the day NJ's rifle and magazine bans came down — NJSP told dealers July 31 in writing. The AG's office now says July 31 is the rehearing-petition deadline, with the ruling expected effective in August; compliance guidance still has not posted.",
            "wrap": true,
            "spacing": "Small"
          },
