          {
            "type": "TextBlock",
            "size": "Small",
            "text": "• NJ: AG calls today the rehearing deadline; bans expected to fall in August\n• Colorado SB25-003 attaches tomorrow; DOR covered-firearms list unpublished\n• DOJ's 7/29 USVI filing: Act 9113 can't moot the suit; argument Aug 19\n• ATF EITB comments close Monday — last working day to file is today",
